# Tab separated translations from foreign film titles to their English equivalents
#
# Create a similar file for titles you want translated, with any name and extension.
# Pass it as a -t parameter to makeIMDbFromFiles.sh, i.e. ./makeIMDbFromFiles.sh -t MyShows.xlate

# Don't use this to map tvEpisode titles to their parent tvSeries. To include a single
# episode, list it in a .tconst file and translate its own title here.

# primaryTitle	Title
Grenseland	Borderliner
Okkupert	Occupied
Ørnen	The Eagle
